status=1
-c:1:21: error: Unable to expand '${%}' because '%' is not a parameter name.
     1 |  x=1; a=(1); echo "${%}"
       |                      ^
note: A name starts with a letter or an underscore, and the special parameters are digits and @ * # ? - $ !.
status=1
